          "passages": [
            {
              "id": "chunk-cd0247728ff5464cac3c6f83c195d70e97c3820c2eba15820987baf57670470f",
              "text": "Blocking TSLP with tezepelumab-ekko \nreduces biomarkers and cytokines associated with inflammation including blood \neosinophils, airway submucosal eosinophils, IgE, FeNO, IL-5, and IL-13; however, the \nmechanism of tezepelumab-ekko action in asthma and CRSwNP has not been \ndefinitively established.\n",
